{"id":"n64085-1-7","stage":3,"title":"소홀하다 · 疏忽","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64085-1-7-1","ko":"어쩌다 이런 사고가 난 것입니까?","zh":"怎么会发生这样的意外呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"意外地","explanation":"어쩌다：意外地","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14591","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고가","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것입니까?","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"意外地","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"14591","definition":"不料偶然地。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/e774f75a4765acabc319.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64085-1-7-2","ko":"제가 그동안 관리를 소홀하게 해 왔던 것 같습니다. 죄송합니다.","zh":"看来是我一直以来疏于管理了。非常抱歉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관리를","meaning":"管理，掌管","explanation":"관리：管理，掌管；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"관리","audio":"/audio/29ae8f308ff1d9963b4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30355","senseId":"1","lemma":"관리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소홀하게","meaning":"疏忽，忽视","explanation":"소홀하다：疏忽，忽视；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"소홀하다","audio":"/audio/0a98eb7b8d69e53dcf8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64085","senseId":"1","lemma":"소홀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔던","meaning":"至今，到现在","explanation":"오다：至今，到现在；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69517","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"29ae8f308ff1d996","term":"관리","zh":"管理，掌管","audio":"/audio/29ae8f308ff1d9963b4d.mp3","entryId":"30355","definition":"负责处理某事。","pronunciation":["괄리"]},{"id":"0a98eb7b8d69e53d","term":"소홀하다","zh":"疏忽，忽视","audio":"/audio/0a98eb7b8d69e53dcf8f.mp3","entryId":"64085","definition":"认为不重要，所以不够注意或尽心。","pronunciation":["소홀하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"至今，到现在","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69517","definition":"表示之前的话语所指的行动或状态继续进行。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/39a127a95732e059c620.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64085","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是我一直以来疏于管理了。非常抱歉。","怎么会发生这样的意外呢？","我该回家了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么会发生这样的意外呢？","我该回家了。","看来是我一直以来疏于管理了。非常抱歉。"],"answer":2}]}
